{"title":"Career Roadmap · EdTech Teacher","role":"EdTech Teacher","summary":"An EdTech Teacher combines professional teaching skills with educational technology to deliver engaging, technology-enabled learning.","facts":{"Current degree":"Other Teacher Education (D.El.Ed / B.El.Ed / B.P.Ed / ITEP / Integrated B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed)","Course":"Integrated B.Ed with Educational Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An EdTech Teacher combines professional teaching skills with educational technology to deliver engaging, technology-enabled learning."},{"type":"p","text":"The role goes beyond simply using a smartboard. An EdTech Teacher understands how to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design digital lessons"},{"text":"Use learning-management systems"},{"text":"Create interactive content"},{"text":"Conduct online and hybrid classes"},{"text":"Use digital assessment"},{"text":"Analyze student-learning data"},{"text":"Apply AI responsibly"},{"text":"Select appropriate educational technology"},{"text":"Support personalized learning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"EdTech Teachers may work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Digital-learning programs"},{"text":"Hybrid schools"},{"text":"Online education platforms"},{"text":"Coaching organizations"},{"text":"Educational NGOs"},{"text":"Corporate learning environments"},{"text":"Curriculum/content organizations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Integrated Teacher Education","Teaching Internship","Educational Technology Skills","EdTech Teacher","Senior / Lead EdTech Teacher","Digital Learning Specialist","Instructional Designer / Learning Experience Designer","EdTech Program Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Teacher Education"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Skills